{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0306F0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"<R=第一代索摩查,Tacho>原本不过是<R=国民警卫队,Guardia>的长官。本来根本不是当总统的料。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=第一代索摩查,Tacho> <R=国民警卫队,Guardia>","cn_utf8_bytes":118,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED;AUX_PRESIDENT_ABILITY_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"但当时的总统没有足以支撑自己的武力。能在力量上和他抗衡的，只有桑地诺将军……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":"JPN_FORCE_BACKING_NUANCE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不，不对。只是将军选择了反抗而已。他并不是什么特别的人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":"JPN_CHOSE_TO_OPPOSE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"要贯彻正义，最重要的是拥有自己的意志。这一点，是我们从他身上学到的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":"JPN_WILL_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"但也正因为这样，索摩查才暗杀了桑地诺……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_ASSASSINATION_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"对。之后就简单了。赶走总统，再通过舞弊选举让自己当选，然后就一直把持着权力。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":"AUX_CONTINUED_POWER_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"真够强硬的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"因为索摩查背后有美国撑腰。美国不愿把政权交给一个反抗他们的将军。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":"AUX_AMERICAN_BACKING_FIRST_SENTENCE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"话虽如此，美国居然会承认那种人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":"AUX_WASHINGTON_PARAPHRASE_REPLACED_BY_JPN"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"听说当时的美国总统说过：“索摩查是个<R=混蛋,son of a bitch>，但他是我们这边的<R=混蛋,son of a bitch>。”","cn_control_tokens":"<R=混蛋,son of a bitch> <R=混蛋,son of a bitch>","cn_utf8_bytes":137,"review_flag":"RUBY_ENGLISH_READING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"也就是说，只要不是反美政权就行。哪怕对方是条狗，或者<R=蛤蟆,索摩查>。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=蛤蟆,索摩查>","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":"RUBY_INSULT_WORDPLAY_PRESERVED;AUX_EXTRA_EXPLANATION_REMOVED"}]}